        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "https://prez.dev/description": [
      {
        "@value": "A type of SLIDE characterised by a non-circular failure which involves translational motion on a near planar slip surface. The movement is largely controlled by surfaces of weakness within the structure of the slope-forming material.",
